6. Third-party components

The npm package contains no third-party code and has no dependencies.

The PyPI package's platform wheels include a Node.js runtime (the "node" or
"node.exe" executable) under the Node.js licence, shipped beside it as
worktrust_cli/runtime/LICENSE. The WorkTrust preservation kit includes the
WorkTrust AI evidence agent kit in its "agent" folder, under the licence shipped
as agent/LICENSE. Those components remain under their own licences, and this
licence does not limit the rights those licences give you.

7. The WorkTrust service

Using the WorkTrust service is governed by its own terms at
https://worktrust.io/eula and its privacy statement at
https://worktrust.io/privacy. This licence grants no right to the service.

